# Folder synchronization, deletions are proposals (specs/003-folder-sync US7). Run after 12-sync-both-ways.walk with the same server and folders: the two-way pair
# Books <-> Mirror exists and has synced every name. The server loses Notes.txt: the sync only proposes; the user chooses; nothing is deleted without a confirmation.
# server remove /Books/Notes.txt
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeSync
waitfor syncPairRow
tap syncPairRow
wait 400
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor planTotals skipped
# the Proposals tab lists the one file that is gone from the server; nothing has been chosen
tap planTab 2
wait 400
expect planRowCaption Deleted on the server
expect planRowCaption No choice yet
shot @OUT@/115-plan-proposals.png
# choose "Delete on the reader": the row says so; Apply choices asks for a confirmation that names the file
tap planRow 0
wait 400
shot @OUT@/116-proposal-choices.png
tap choiceRow 2
wait 400
expect planRowCaption Delete on the reader
tap planApply
waitfor planConfirmDelete
expect dialogText cannot be recovered with this app
shot @OUT@/117-confirm-delete.png
# decline first: nothing is applied and the choice stays
tap footerButton 0
wait 400
expect planRowCaption Delete on the reader
# then apply for real
tap planApply
waitfor planConfirmDelete
tap footerButton 1
waitfor resultCounts deleted
shot @OUT@/118-result-deleted.png
tap resultDone
waitfor syncPairRow
